---
const { lang } = Astro.props;
---
<section class="runtime-view">
    <div class="container fade-up">
        {lang === 'en' ? (
            <>
            <div class="section-label">Runtime Foundations</div>
            <h2 class="section-title">The substrate beneath the framework.</h2>
            <p class="section-sub">The tooling that keeps frontier agents anchored to repo truth, instead of their own hallucinations.</p>
            </>
        ) : (
            <>
            <div class="section-label">Fundamenty runtime</div>
            <h2 class="section-title">Substrat pod frameworkiem.</h2>
            <p class="section-sub">Narzędzia, które trzymają agentów zakotwiczonych w prawdzie repo, zamiast w ich własnych halucynacjach.</p>
            </>
        )}
        <div class="foundation-grid">
            <a class="foundation-card" href="https://loct.io">
                <div class="foundation-icon foundation-icon--steel">01</div>
                <h3>loctree</h3>
                {lang === 'en' ? (
                    <>
                    <p class="foundation-role">Perception Engine</p>
                    <p>AST-augmented architectural memory. The eyes for every agent &mdash; forces LLMs to see the full repo structure before modifying a single file.</p>
                    </>
                ) : (
                    <>
                    <p class="foundation-role">Silnik percepcji</p>
                    <p>Pamięć architektoniczna wzbogacona AST. Oczy każdego agenta &mdash; zmusza LLM-y do zobaczenia pełnej struktury repo przed modyfikacją jakiegokolwiek pliku.</p>
                    </>
                )}
                <span class="foundation-link">loct.io</span>
            </a>
            <a class="foundation-card" href="https://github.com/VetCoders/ai-contexters">
                <div class="foundation-icon foundation-icon--copper">02</div>
                <h3>aicx-mcp</h3>
                {lang === 'en' ? (
                    <>
                    <p class="foundation-role">History Retrieval</p>
                    <p>Indexes decisions, intents, and outcomes from every AI session. Agents retrieve what was decided and why, ensuring session-to-session continuity.</p>
                    </>
                ) : (
                    <>
                    <p class="foundation-role">Odzyskiwanie historii</p>
                    <p>Indeksuje decyzje, intencje i wyniki z każdej sesji AI. Agenci odzyskują co zdecydowano i dlaczego, zapewniając ciągłość między sesjami.</p>
                    </>
                )}
                <span class="foundation-link">github.com/VetCoders/ai-contexters</span>
            </a>
            <a class="foundation-card" href="https://github.com/VetCoders/prview">
                <div class="foundation-icon foundation-icon--patina">03</div>
                <h3>prview</h3>
                {lang === 'en' ? (
                    <>
                    <p class="foundation-role">Audit &amp; Quality Gate</p>
                    <p>Generates durable PR review packs with line-level findings. The merge gate that turns terminal dumps into actual artifacts.</p>
                    </>
                ) : (
                    <>
                    <p class="foundation-role">Audyt i bramka jakości</p>
                    <p>Generuje trwałe paczki review PR z findingami na poziomie linii. Bramka merge, która zamienia zrzuty terminala w rzeczywiste artefakty.</p>
                    </>
                )}
                <span class="foundation-link">github.com/VetCoders/prview</span>
            </a>
            <a class="foundation-card" href="https://github.com/VetCoders/screenscribe">
                <div class="foundation-icon foundation-icon--muted">04</div>
                <h3>ScreenScribe</h3>
                {lang === 'en' ? (
                    <>
                    <p class="foundation-role">Visual Reviewer</p>
                    <p>Turns narrated screencasts into structured engineering findings. The orchestrator's eye on the real product surface.</p>
                    </>
                ) : (
                    <>
                    <p class="foundation-role">Wizualny recenzent</p>
                    <p>Zamienia nagrane screencasty w ustrukturyzowane findingi inżynierskie. Oko orkiestratora na rzeczywistą powierzchnię produktu.</p>
                    </>
                )}
                <span class="foundation-link">github.com/VetCoders/screenscribe</span>
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
